[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    45[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ```sh
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    46[0m:[38;5;10m[49m nm -D -u translation/target/release/libcollided_lib.so
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    47[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ```
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    48[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    49[0m:[38;5;10m[49m No non-libc undefined symbols that the C `.so` would have to provide.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    50[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    51[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ## Build products
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    52[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
