[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    54[0m:[38;5;10m[49m There is **no binary executable / driver** in this project, so the
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    55[0m:[38;5;10m[49m "compare C and Rust stdout" clause of Phase B does not apply.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    56[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    57[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ## Feature combinations
